      "message": "Per the SDM \"The instruction executing when an NMI interrupt is received is completed before the NMI is generated\", so it looks like the RIP saved in pt_regs is not pointing the wrmsrq instruction but the next one so the search_table cannot find a match entry for this RIP?\n\nI think what this patch does is still good, as unconditionally calling exception fixup for all exceptions is a weak implementation, and this patch can improve it.",
